This repository's own, not from upstream: board/ (BSD-2-Clause-Patent, but for the derived files above), abi/NativeAdrenoABI.h (a
wrapper that includes Adreno830's v2 header unchanged and adds the one v1 name Turnip's darwin KMD uses; MIT like the header it
wraps) and abi/abi_handshake.cpp (BSD-2-Clause-Patent; the KMD's call sequence, run on Adreno830's tests/hostsim by
tooling/k27/check-a830-abi-host.py).

